WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:07.130
<i>It appeared as though humanity 
would be destroyed by the demons.</i>

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.320
<i>But a single mage saved them all.</i>

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:27.600
<i>He was called the Wizard King,
and he became a legend.</i>

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:34.280
Gel Magic: Sticky Salamander!

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.410
Mine!

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:42.080
Remember this, Magic Knights.

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:44.800
We are the Eye of the Midnight Sun...

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:48.360
The ones who will destroy the Clover Kingdom.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:56.720
Asta!

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:01.850
I've been waiting for you.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.470
H-He's...

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.980
The Wizard King, Julius Novachrono?!

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.100
Kill him!

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:12.870
I-Impossible!

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.070
I killed them.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.200
It would've been too difficult 
with your numbers.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.120
How about it? I'll let one of you 
survive, so why not surrender?

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:24.040
It'll be first come, first served.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:26.700
Don't underestimate us!

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:34.380
<i>How is he moving like that?!
I can't keep up!</i>

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:36.410
I guess I don't have a choice.

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:38.880
I might be able to handle these numbers.

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:43.580
Time Binding Magic: Chrono Stasis.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.390
<i>What... is this?</i>

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:49.890
<i>I can't move...</i>

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:51.900
<i>...at all.</i>

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.720
I guess I was able to restrain all of you.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.900
Were you more worn out than I thought?

00:01:58.950 --> 00:01:59.800
Ow...

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.410
Hey there, Asta.

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:05.160
We seem to be connected by fate somehow.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:06.910
R-Right...

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:10.790
You want to become the 
Wizard King someday, right?

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:15.550
In that case, watch carefully 
and don't look away.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:20.550
This is only a small fraction 
of what you'll have to surpass.

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.080
<i>Something's coming?</i>

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:27.640
That's blinding!

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:34.360
What is this light?!

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:02.880
<i>I would always close my eyes</i>

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:07.220
<i>And cower at reality</i>

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:11.910
<i>I can't stand the idea</i>

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:16.270
<i>Of just making excuses to give up</i>

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.480
<i>Stand right there</i>

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.540
<i>I don't want to be near you</i>

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:19.680
<i>Any minute now</i>

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:23.070
<i>Just wait right there</i>

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.070
<i>(The decisive battle is still a long way off)</i>

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:25.160
<i>Black and blue</i>

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:31.080
<i>I'll give up on giving up</i>

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:34.580
<i>And get the world on my side</i>

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:38.230
<i>I'm looking for the reason I'm alive</i>

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:43.470
<i>Every time somewhere under this sky</i>

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:49.320
<i>Break through the tearful nights</i>

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:52.600
<i>And head where the light shines</i>

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:56.440
<i>I want to keep my promise</i>

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:59.980
<i>I'll deliver it to you</i>

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:03.960
<i>shape of love</i>

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:11.700
<b>Light</b>

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:21.670
Everyone's gone!

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:23.800
Looks like he got us.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:26.800
He took all of his little friends back.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:32.010
Light magic that's faster than my own... 
I wonder if that was the enemy's boss.

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:36.280
He seems interesting... I mean, formidable.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:37.830
But...

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:39.980
We managed to keep one.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.890
<i>I finally got through.</i>

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.150
<i>Where are you, Wizard King?</i>

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:48.830
Hello there, Marx.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:55.020
Sorry about that. I've been a bit busy, 
so I blocked the communication spell.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:59.130
<i>Never mind that. Please hurry
to the medical ward.</i>

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:21.400
Fuegoleon... Leopold...

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.170
I hope they wake up soon.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.150
Indeed.

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:29.450
We've strengthened the magic barrier 
and repaired the communication spells.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.070
We've gathered more Magic Knights

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:33.320
and are having them scout 
every inch of the town

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:34.540
to ensure no enemies remain.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:37.560
I'm sure the royal capital is fine now.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:43.130
We're also looking for that awfully loud—
er, lively Black Bulls boy.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.550
He wouldn't die so easily!

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:53.880
Curse you, Asta. I'm going to 
punch you when you get back.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.960
This magic...

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.390
Hey, everyone. Great work.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:02.150
Th-The Wizard King?

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.410
Asta!

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:06.030
H-Hey, guys. Looks like you're all here.

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.770
Is that... an enemy?

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:12.280
Man, I thought I was done for.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:17.390
Hmph! It's because you're always so reckless.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.350
I hope you learned your lesson, Stupidsta.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.540
Thank goodness!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.890
Asta!

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:26.330
You're safe, Asta!

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:29.230
I'm... I'm so glad you came back alive!

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:32.920
I thought you were dead. I'm so glad.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:37.470
Y-Yeah... Thanks for worrying about me.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.430
<i>I thought you were going to punch him.</i>

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:42.400
Asta!

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:46.330
I was so, so worried about you!

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:49.280
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:50.860
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:53.860
I see...

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:59.090
Despite how strong Fuegoleon is, 
we don't know when he'll wake up.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.990
That was a miscalculation on my part.

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:06.410
No, this was due to our inexperience.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:11.630
We've confirmed that the pendant 
Fuegoleon was wearing is missing.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.310
Pendant?

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:15.890
Could that be what they were after?

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.810
Who in the world could they be?

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.080
From what they said,

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.400
they appear to be a terrorist group 
with a grudge against the kingdom.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:28.210
We are the Eye of the Midnight Sun...

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:31.900
The ones who will destroy the Clover Kingdom.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:35.250
But it doesn't seem to be that simple.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:38.910
<i>The jewels embedded into that stone slab...</i>

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:43.160
<i>Was Fuegoleon's pendant a part of that?</i>

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:45.480
<i>It had several holes 
that were still empty,</i>

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.670
<i>but what happens when 
they gather all of them?</i>

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:54.180
<i>There is the possibility that Fuegoleon 
was targeted because of his pendant,</i>

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.590
<i>but there's also a high possibility</i>

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:01.680
<i>that his strength and ideals 
would've gotten in their way.</i>

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:05.710
<i>I've been investigating 
various dissidents in secret,</i>

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.440
<i>and this is the first time 
I've picked up their trail.</i>

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:13.440
<i>But to think that they were planning 
something that extraordinary and powerful.</i>

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:16.680
<i>Maybe I shouldn't have left the capital.</i>

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:20.810
We'll get the details from our captive later.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:22.450
In any case,

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:25.880
people look to the
Magic Knights for one thing...

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:28.790
Peace in the Clover Kingdom.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:32.710
In order to preserve that, we'll keep 
fighting with everything we have.

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:33.700
Yes, sir!

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.970
If you'll excuse me.

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:36.640
Nozel...

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.410
<i>What is that guy's problem?</i>

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:44.730
<i>We're supposed to be showing solidarity 
right now. Take the hint, man!</i>

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:44.260
Has the enemy

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:50.230
awakened not a sleeping lion, 
but a sleeping hawk?

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:53.480
<i>Pathetic.</i>

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.200
<i>What an appalling spectacle.</i>

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:59.020
<i>Never let this happen again, Nozel.</i>

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:03.740
<i>And Fuegoleon, I will find 
the scum who did this to you</i>

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:06.890
<i>and slay them myself.</i>

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:14.640
I hope I never feel this useless again.

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:16.350
Right.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:19.170
We shall become stronger.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:20.570
Indeed.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:23.260
I'm the one who'll become the strongest!

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:24.730
Leopold!

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.640
You need to be resting!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:31.300
Asta! I'm relieved that 
we both pulled through!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:36.650
As my rival who has faced death 
with me, you must also get stronger!

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:39.410
I will surpass my brother!

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.450
I'm going to be the next Wizard King!

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.910
And this...

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.170
Fuegoleon,

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:54.900
what is that mark on your forehead?

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.920
Ah, this?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:10:01.430
This mark is handed down in the Vermillion 
family as a sign of a personal oath.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:05.430
It's worn only by those prepared to 
conquer themselves and become king.

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:12.100
This... is the mark of my oath.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:18.750
Yeah! I don't really get it, but it looks 
like you're worthy to be my rival.

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:21.660
So... who the heck are you, anyway?!

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:22.620
What?!

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:25.680
How?! How could you still not know who I am?!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:28.730
I only remember people who 
properly introduce themselves!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.590
I am Leopold Vermillion!

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:32.700
We're going to be friends, 
so call me Leo!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:34.780
Y-You're moving way too fast!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.990
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.590
<i>The Wizard King concluded that 
the attack on the royal capital</i>

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:46.890
<i>had been the work of 
anti-Clover Kingdom terrorists.</i>

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:51.640
<i>He declared his intent to continue 
resolutely opposing them,</i>

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:54.750
<i>and the masses were fully supportive.</i>

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:58.070
<i>The enemy's invasion was enabled by</i>

00:10:58.070 --> 00:11:02.670
<i>the disappearance of some of the mages who 
maintained the capital's magic barrier.</i>

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:07.240
<i>Had the enemy done away
with them, or had they defected?</i>

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:15.920
<i>This fact was not made public,
but the Wizard King was sure of it.</i>

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:18.420
<i>I don't want to believe it,</i>

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.880
<i>but there's a traitor among the 
mages in the royal capital.</i>

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:38.980
<b>Interrogation Room</b>

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:38.980
It's no use.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.990
There's some kind of protection on them,

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.850
and I can't search for information.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.230
Even if there wasn't, we'd never talk.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.760
Our master is the light in the darkness!

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:54.500
He's our god!

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:59.510
He's the only one who hasn't abandoned us.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.760
We will never betray him.

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:15.770
Apparently, their master has some absolute
unifying force and fearsome magical power.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:21.100
I'm assuming the one who defeated 
Captain Fuegoleon is also their master.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:22.030
Indeed.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:27.030
When he wakes up, we may learn something.

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:31.390
Let us wait for the Lion King to awaken.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.160
Damn it! Damn it!

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.210
Damn it!

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:40.000
Damn it all to hell!

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.830
They hurt. They hurt...

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.510
My wounds hurt!

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:47.720
That stupid little brat Asta...

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:50.010
I'm going to kill him, no matter what!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:54.230
I'm going to gather the 
ultimate army of the dead!

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:57.220
That anti-magic kid, Asta...

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:00.380
You can't kill him, Rades.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:04.680
I want to tinker with him 
while he's still alive.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:05.690
What?

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.780
Not to mention, I already 
treated your wounds,

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:11.070
so there's no way they'd still be hurting.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:14.060
Shut up! They still ache!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.890
I saw that brat first!

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:18.960
Hands off, Sally!

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:22.270
Can't hear you, can't hear you,
can't hear you!

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:27.030
I hope I see you again soon, Asta!

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.230
For the next time I see you, Asta...

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:40.730
I'll use the little samples 
I got while you were in the gel,

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:43.880
and research and research!

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:49.990
I couldn't save Geork and Catherine.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:56.000
Those two have big egos, 
but they worship you.

00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:59.200
They won't give them any information on us.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:02.250
That's not what I'm worried about.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:06.630
As long as they're alive, I will
save them, no matter what.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:19.320
I thought I had dodged it, but I seem 
to have taken a little of the attack.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:24.950
Magic that accelerates 
time... and drastically.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:29.780
The Wizard King... As expected, 
he has phenomenal power.

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:39.040
But we will build up our 
strength and defeat him.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:52.400
In order to get our revenge and establish 
a new country that will be ours alone.

00:14:57.510 --> 00:15:00.180
Mister and Miss Magic Knight,

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:02.390
thank you for saving me!

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:04.340
No problem!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.690
I just did the obvious thing.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:10.190
This is to thank you. I made them myself.

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.410
They look great!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.500
Thank you so much!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:17.570
Bye, now!

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:25.520
So good!

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.190
Why...

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:28.210
...are you here, Charmy?

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:31.630
Where the nummy things are,
there I shall be!

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.930
More importantly, have a bite.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.650
La? La?

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:39.100
Uh, she gave those to <i>us</i>...

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:41.550
Don't sweat the details.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:43.440
Come on. They're delicious.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:45.590
Th-Thanks?

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:48.130
I guess I don't mind having one...

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:52.590
It's good!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.600
What a surprise. It's actually good.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:00.710
You seem to be in an unusually good mood.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:03.360
I had a fateful encounter.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.930
You're probably too young to understand.

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:10.550
By the way, how did you get into the castle?

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:12.090
Like this!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.800
Seriously?

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:22.270
<i>Is her magic actually really amazing?</i>

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.280
That's...

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.510
Hey!

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:31.370
It's Asta and Noelle.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.460
Asta!

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:38.870
Have your wounds fully healed?
I asked you that before, didn't I?

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:42.580
I'm fine, like I said before!

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:48.520
Yuno, I heard you took down the enemy 
like it was nothing, you jerkface!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:49.590
Jerkface?

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:52.130
My meal-saving prince!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:56.590
Hey, Yuno! Greet me properly, you jerk!

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:58.550
Wait, you know my prince?

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:01.750
Don't get a big head just 
because you took one down!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.890
Courtesy makes the world go round!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.190
Yuno?

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:38.990
Huh? Was that too much?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.970
What do you think you're doing, Yuno?!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:46.110
Is he stupid?! Was he 
actually trying to kill us?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.980
<b>See ya, Shrimpsta</b>

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:50.390
<i>See ya, Shrimpsta.</i>

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:54.730
Who are you calling "Shrimpsta," 
Yuno, you jerk?!

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.830
Come down here and fight me right now!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:18:00.870
Don't shoot something like that 
just so you can write magic letters!

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:03.280
Don't you dare ignore me and leave!

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:06.370
Ah, the ferocious storm of love.

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:09.440
Ignoring me is the worst thing you could do!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:10.730
Hey, wait, Yuno!

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:16.200
<i>Yuno's magic has gotten much stronger.</i>

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.010
<i>What could've happened in 
such a short amount of time?</i>

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:24.010
<i>Asta,</i>

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:26.170
<i>I'm going to get stronger,</i>

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:30.120
<i>so the next time we meet, I'll be
able to fight alongside you!</i>

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:34.020
<i>And then... And then...</i>

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:43.030
I guess we'll just have to fight 
when we both get a lot stronger.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:45.430
<i>I'm not going to lose, Yuno!</i>

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:49.790
<i>The stronger you become, 
I'll get even stronger!</i>

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:55.790
<b>Black Bulls' Base</b>

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:55.790
Welcome back, Magna, Luck!

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:59.200
Man, I'm so exhausted from my mission.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.130
So tired.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:02.200
However!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:05.510
We got recognized for our 
deeds and got a star!

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:08.850
That's right, Magna!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:08.850
Not so close!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:13.150
Our combo attack, the Crackling Magna
Typhoon, was amazing, wasn't it?

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:15.690
<b>Crackling Magna Typhoon</b>

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:15.690
We're never doing that move again!

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.690
Thank goodness you're all back safe.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:23.470
I'm gonna keep on showing the 
other Black Bulls how it's done!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:28.450
Asta, my time has arrived! 
Make sure you keep up!

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.550
Yes, sir!

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:31.150
Oh, by the way, Magna.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:31.960
What's up?

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:35.880
They were so impressed with what I did 
during all the trouble at the capital

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:40.290
that they made me a third-class junior 
Magic Knight at a special awards ceremony!

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:42.990
Huh?

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:42.990
What?!

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:46.660
Wait, what's a third-class 
junior Magic Knight?

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:47.470
No idea.

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:48.700
What?!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:53.670
Have you guys been Magic Knights all 
this time without knowing what that is?

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.610
It's a Magic Knight rank.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:02.010
And since you guys haven't 
changed since you all joined,

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.490
you're still fifth-class Magic Knights.

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:06.480
Better start showing Asta some respect.

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.740
What?!

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.740
Huh?

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:11.280
And by the way, Charmy became 
a first-class junior Magic Knight.

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:13.500
On your knees, inferiors!

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:15.600
What?!

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:20.130
Make sure you follow me, you inferiors!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:25.130
Apparently, they were impressed that 
she captured one of the rebels.

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:28.150
Looks to me like she was just trying 
to beat her up, though.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.290
Worship me!

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.320
What's that weird dance?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.270
This is somehow very infuriating!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.240
Anyway, well done, kid.

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:47.820
But Captain Fuegoleon...

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.530
Huh? Fuegoleon?

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.040
Who do you think you're worrying about, punk?

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:57.670
That hot-blooded king of seriousness 
won't die that easily.

00:20:57.670 --> 00:21:00.540
I bet he'll come back even stronger.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:02.750
Of course!

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:07.790
All right! I'm going to train even 
harder and get stronger, too!

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:08.800
No, you're gonna rest.

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:09.870
Huh?

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:12.650
You're too injured. You're going
to die. Are you stupid?

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:15.560
<i>But you made me do it in the first place!</i>

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:17.430
Yeah! You need to take a break!

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:18.550
You too, Noelle?

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:19.560
How stupid are you?

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:21.270
A break...

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:23.070
A break? You're getting time off, Asta?

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:25.440
Then let's head to a mixer!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.450
Huh?!

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.570
A m-mixer?!

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:29.700
You get to work.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:31.880
I'll set everything up!

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:32.950
I just told you to get to work.

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:35.050
Things are getting busy!

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:36.200
I'll kill you.

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:38.960
Wait, do you wanna come too, Captain Yami?

00:21:57.390 --> 00:22:02.740
<i>My dry emotions gaze at the me from that day</i>

00:22:02.740 --> 00:22:05.710
<i>And push me forward</i>

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:07.780
<i>(I can't find a place to go)</i>

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:13.030
<i>Even the faintest light can 
still break through the darkness</i>

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:18.530
<i>And change the flow of time</i>

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:20.950
<i>(I will keep believing in you)</i>

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:23.830
<i>In this ever-vivid place</i>

00:22:23.830 --> 00:22:26.800
<i>(Break free yourself)</i>

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:29.670
<i>In order to grasp my endless dream</i>

00:22:29.670 --> 00:22:32.330
<i>If there is a path that I should choose</i>

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:34.390
<i>(Do you wanna try? Do you wanna try?)</i>

00:22:34.390 --> 00:22:37.300
<i>Wherever it may lead us</i>

00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:39.790
<i>Until my life comes to an end</i>

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:42.470
<i>I will accept any pain that comes my way</i>

00:22:42.470 --> 00:22:44.490
<i>(We can try again, we can try again)</i>

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:48.850
<i>Even if we can't see tomorrow</i>

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:54.400
<i>Holding onto feelings too intense to voice</i>

00:22:54.990 --> 00:22:58.130
<i>I'll keep screaming them in my heart</i>

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:13.430
<b>Petit Clover</b>

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:12.910
Petit Clover!

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:16.930
<b>Captain Yami's Lecture
on Magic Knight Rankings</b>

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:16.350
"Captain Yami's"... Wait, what is this?

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:19.830
"Magic Knight"... Ugh, I can't be bothered.

00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:20.430
<b>Wizard King
Grand Magic Knight
1st-5th Class Senior Magic Knight
1st-5th Class Intermediate Magic Knight
1st Class Junior Magic Knight
2nd Class Junior Magic Knight</b>

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:29.730
<b>Wizard King
Grand Magic Knight
1st-5th Class Senior Magic Knight
1st-5th Class Intermediate Magic Knight
1st Class Junior Magic Knight
2nd Class Junior Magic Knight
 3rd Class Junior Magic Knight
4th Class Junior Magic Knight
5th Class Junior Magic Knight</b>

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:26.360
So the most important is the Wizard King, 
and then there's Grand Magic Knight...

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:27.720
This is too much work.

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:29.730
Why are you making a
Grand Magic Knight read this?

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:31.090
I'll kill you!

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:34.200
What?!

00:23:35.660 --> 00:23:38.620
Is this what they call love?

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:41.910
My meal-saving prince!

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:47.170
<i>Black Clover</i>, Page 28:
"The One I've Set My Heart On."

00:23:44.420 --> 00:23:53.140
Page 28

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:49.840
Wait, is Asta falling in love, too?
